{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act43side_level_act43side_02_beg",
  "groupId": "act43side",
  "stageId": "act43side_02",
  "title": "排演一齣悲劇",
  "storyCode": "AD-2",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act43side/level_act43side_02_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "b5cd87a2d16c9b14a14d36dd6122ec49e216080166cd86d8c6101a6523a16a2e",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邁克爾",
      "text": "忘記不幸遇害的兄長，跟我私奔吧，杜邦夫人！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米蘭妮",
      "text": "清醒一點，第二個洛克菲勒！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米蘭妮",
      "text": "你也聽到了那個信使說的，根本不存在什麼“杜邦夫人”，什麼高貴、優雅、知性……所有我身上你們所愛的東西都是無根的浮萍……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米蘭妮",
      "text": "我不配成為你們兄弟三人中任何一人的妻子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邁克爾",
      "text": "我愛你，就算你不姓杜邦我也依然愛你！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邁克爾",
      "text": "是你的兄長，那個死掉的傢伙一直在利用你，你被蒙在鼓裡，你也是受害者，你又何苦為此自責？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米蘭妮",
      "text": "可是……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邁克爾",
      "text": "可是？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米蘭妮",
      "text": "現在會客廳擠滿了前來弔唁的賓客，雖然“杜邦”只是一個虛名，但於情於理我都不應該當著他們的面離開……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邁克爾",
      "text": "我有辦法能讓我們現在就離開宅邸，從此再也不理會家族紛爭。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米蘭妮",
      "text": "這要如何做到？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邁克爾",
      "text": "你忘記了？我是一名軍人，親愛的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邁克爾",
      "text": "你看！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米蘭妮",
      "text": "這、這是……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邁克爾",
      "text": "我在這座宅邸的儲藏室蒐集了材料，製作了這條鋼索……抓緊吊纜，我們就能從這個露台直接飛躍花園，抵達屋後的森林。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邁克爾",
      "text": "跟我走吧，去一個不在乎財富和階級的地方！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米蘭妮",
      "text": "啊，軍人先生，你的方法還是太野蠻了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米蘭妮",
      "text": "萬一滑輪卡住，我們會懸掛在半空中好幾個小時，直到有人發現我們……或者繩索斷裂直接墜入森林……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邁克爾",
      "text": "相信我，裝置非常安全。我不會讓你受傷的，親愛的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米蘭妮",
      "text": "洛克菲勒，這是真、真的嗎？我、我覺得我快掉下去了——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝莉",
      "text": "啊——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“有人掉下來了！快！快叫救護車！滿地都是血……謝莉！你還愣在這裡做什麼！”\n脊背被寒意攫住，手指連動也不能動，神經也跟隨繩索緩慢斷裂的聲音不斷受到拉扯。\n“到底是怎麼回事……”\n“所以，劇組的結論就是，她的死只是鋼絲年久老舊造成的意外？就這樣輕描淡寫地解決了？這是死了一個人啊！”\n不像……對……兩起事故一點都不像。道爾頓死於刀下，而五年前的演員死於墜亡。\n咯吱。咯吱。不祥的斷裂聲再次響起。在哪裡？究竟在哪裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "……謝莉，謝莉！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "發什麼呆啊，快點離開那裡，貨箱要掉下來了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝莉",
      "text": "掉……掉下來？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "謝莉僵在原地，呆板地抬頭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她看著吊在空中的貨箱離頭頂越來越近，彷彿吊在空中的是自己，而她即將墜落。\n在貨箱佔據謝莉視野的下一秒，影子出現在她的身旁，一雙有力的手握住她的手臂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "謝莉感到一陣天旋地轉，回過神時她已離開了原來的位置，安穩落在拍攝現場的另一邊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盧西恩",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝莉",
      "text": "盧西恩……謝、謝謝你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盧西恩",
      "text": "可以放手了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝莉",
      "text": "啊，對不起。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盧西恩",
      "text": "不是說你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盧西恩",
      "text": "莫伊拉，你是叫這個名字吧……可以放手了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫伊拉",
      "text": "好……好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "謝莉這才看到，連接著貨箱的繩索被小個子的道具師死死地拉在手上，她的手臂在顫抖，臉也憋得通紅。\n直到盧西恩重複了一遍，她才慢慢地鬆開手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盧西恩",
      "text": "你的神經太緊繃了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫伊拉",
      "text": "這、這是我作為道具組長的職責。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝莉",
      "text": "這到底是怎麼回事……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人員",
      "text": "怎麼回事，我還想問你呢，怎麼回事？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人員",
      "text": "這些貨箱確實使用好幾年了，需要重新檢查一遍以防繩索再次鬆脫，但你——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人員",
      "text": "你真的是瘋了，謝莉！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人員",
      "text": "莫名其妙驚叫出聲，打斷了拍攝不說，連危險逼近了都不知道躲開嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人員",
      "text": "你難道是第一次看劇組拍吊鋼絲嗎？嚇成這樣！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝莉",
      "text": "不……米蘭妮和邁克爾的樣子，讓我想起了五年前那個墜落的——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾塔",
      "text": "謝莉，你先下去休息吧，別干擾劇組正常拍攝。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝莉",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盧西恩",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Miss.Christine",
      "text": "（跳過道具箱）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Miss.Christine",
      "text": "（貼近盧西恩）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝莉",
      "text": "沒、沒什麼，這個神秘的黑傢伙剛剛在那邊亂竄，我被嚇到了……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝莉",
      "text": "對不起，請繼續拍攝吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Miss.Christine",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Miss.Christine",
      "text": "（不滿地甩動雙尾）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邁克爾",
      "text": "如果仔細看……謝莉長得也不差，就是總愛大驚小怪的，讓人心裡發毛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邁克爾",
      "text": "剛剛那場戲被打斷真可惜，我的情緒正漸入佳境……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米蘭妮",
      "text": "“漸入佳境”？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米蘭妮",
      "text": "邁克爾，你要感謝那位統籌小姐。要不是她中斷拍攝，下一秒我就要罵出口了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米蘭妮",
      "text": "台詞、身形、情感……一無是處，整整兩個月的拍攝，到現在你的表現甚至沒有那位只演了一場戲的新人亮眼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米蘭妮",
      "text": "我告訴過你，別把私生活的那一套帶進拍攝裡，現在看來，根本問題在於格蕾塔看錯人了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米蘭妮",
      "text": "她根本不該找只靠一對紅耳朵就接到戲的偶像派擔任主角，還一人分飾三角。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邁克爾",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邁克爾",
      "text": "您說得對。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米蘭妮",
      "text": "哦，怎麼一副無精打采的樣子？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米蘭妮",
      "text": "平時這個時候，你早就開始用油腔滑調的語氣為自己辯解了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邁克爾",
      "text": "不就是因為想起可憐的老道爾頓了嗎……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邁克爾",
      "text": "我沒有您資深，進組經驗也不夠豐富。剛剛被謝莉的意外影響，現在又有點心神不寧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米蘭妮",
      "text": "專業一點。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米蘭妮",
      "text": "意外、失敗、負面評價……要是會被這些小事影響到表演的狀態，根本沒辦法在藍卡塢待下去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邁克爾",
      "text": "唉，我的抗壓能力還不夠強，得向您多多請教……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邁克爾",
      "text": "我聽說瑪麗安娜女士憑一部二十八天拍成的影片包攬藍卡塢電影節各類獎項時，您就在她的身後？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米蘭妮",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邁克爾",
      "text": "就算顆粒無收，被報紙和記者冷嘲熱諷，您還是照常回到劇組完成了當天的拍攝。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邁克爾",
      "text": "要是我必須跟這樣璀璨奪目的演員競爭，可能早就不拍戲了……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米蘭妮",
      "text": "你這是什麼意思？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邁克爾",
      "text": "我……哦！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邁克爾",
      "text": "不不不，您誤會了，我只是想瞭解您面對道爾頓的意外能保持鎮定的秘訣，絕對沒有別的意思！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米蘭妮",
      "text": "秘訣？沒有什麼秘訣，只是因為我並不熟悉道爾頓，也與那起事故毫無關係。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米蘭妮",
      "text": "反倒是你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米蘭妮",
      "text": "你為他心神不寧那麼久，難道他的死與你有關？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邁克爾",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝莉",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝莉",
      "text": "難道這一切真的只是巧合？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝莉",
      "text": "難道只是我的疑心病太重？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝莉",
      "text": "難道我真的應該去看一下心理醫生？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "Miss.Christine不該成為你的藉口。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝莉",
      "text": "誰！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盧西恩",
      "text": "謝莉小姐，Miss.Christine當時並沒有出現在你所說的位置，更不會亂竄驚嚇到你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝莉",
      "text": "我……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝莉",
      "text": "盧西恩，請你代替我向你的同伴說聲抱歉吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盧西恩",
      "text": "我會的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盧西恩",
      "text": "所以，你恐懼的究竟是什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝莉",
      "text": "……你應該問五年前劇組發生意外後，還有什麼不令我恐懼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盧西恩",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝莉",
      "text": "你的眼神寫滿了好奇。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝莉",
      "text": "我可以告訴你——其實本來也不是什麼秘密，打聽一下就能知道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝莉",
      "text": "那個發生意外的女孩，叫勞拉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝莉",
      "text": "她是一個初到藍卡塢的新人演員，被格蕾塔女士招募進組，對自己的工作熱情得過分，但完全不懂行業的規矩。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝莉",
      "text": "道爾頓當時已經染上酒癮，但人氣未減。為了教訓一下不禮貌的後輩，他故意臨時加戲，讓小演員在鋼絲上吊了六七個小時。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝莉",
      "text": "沒想到裝置老舊導致繩索鬆脫……那名演員墜落身亡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝莉",
      "text": "下一秒，血液從那名演員身下蔓延開，就像那天道爾頓的樣子……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "盧西恩看向謝莉的手臂，潛意識的不安教唆她對自己的身體行兇，血痕遍布。\n謝莉立即拉下捲在手臂上的袖子，神色不安。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝莉",
      "text": "我會解決自己的問題。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盧西恩",
      "text": "你低估了所謂的“問題”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盧西恩",
      "text": "它會出現得越來越頻繁，原本只是類似的聲響才會引發幻覺，而現在哪怕只是拖動椅子，也會把你拉回那段過去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝莉",
      "text": "感謝你的關心，盧西恩“醫生”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝莉",
      "text": "我和我腦中邪惡的小聲響已經相處了五年，我瞭解它們。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝莉",
      "text": "我只能跟它們賽跑，在恐懼和非理性徹底佔據我的大腦之前，盡可能多做些什麼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝莉",
      "text": "或許道爾頓的死真的是一個意外，但我需要排除所有風險和威脅，避免五年前的事再次上演。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝莉",
      "text": "哪怕那些威脅來自於劇組的發起者……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盧西恩",
      "text": "你還有別的顧慮。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝莉",
      "text": "格蕾塔對我隱瞞了什麼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝莉",
      "text": "我們共用一個辦公室，移動地塊開出藍卡塢主城區前，我在她桌上發現一份奇怪的文件，正想打開的時候被她攔下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝莉",
      "text": "謎題越來越多，而我跟那些相熟的成員分享著一段不堪的回憶，無法保持坦誠。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝莉",
      "text": "現在還有惱人的聲音和幻覺打斷我的思緒……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盧西恩",
      "text": "疼痛是一種緩解方法。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝莉",
      "text": "你說……什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盧西恩",
      "text": "我說，“疼痛”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盧西恩",
      "text": "它無法解決你的幻覺和歇斯底里，但能為你提供喘息的機會，讓你完成自己真正想做的事，解開未知的謎題。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盧西恩",
      "text": "那些難以分辨真假的聲音和影子會藏在細小的夾縫中，在你試圖找回自我的時候阻止你，擾亂你……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盧西恩",
      "text": "疼痛是用來對抗它們的方法，只不過指甲的硬度可能不夠。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盧西恩",
      "text": "筆尖、刀鋒……只要用力得當，任何銳利的人造物品都能為你提供幫助。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盧西恩",
      "text": "舌頭、手背、腿根……這些部位對疼痛更加敏感。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝莉",
      "text": "你……真是個奇怪的人，但你似乎很瞭解幻覺。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝莉",
      "text": "你曾經用這種方法讓自己鎮靜下來？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝莉",
      "text": "你到底是什麼人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "疼痛是一種緩解方式。\n古怪的低語、可怕的景象……\n只是和謝莉不同，他需要解決的問題，並非對這些事物的恐懼，而是，渴望。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "劇團成員A",
      "text": "盧西恩還沒歸還源石唱片機？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "劇團成員B",
      "text": "還沒。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "劇團成員B",
      "text": "他應該也很著急吧，“白英花”不是說他最近焦慮得徹夜難眠嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "劇團成員B",
      "text": "狂喜和狂悲都太表象了，他體會不到更複雜更極端的情感，自然也就沒辦法突破演技的瓶頸……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "劇團成員A",
      "text": "但他還那麼年輕，急什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "劇團成員B",
      "text": "盧西恩已經加入劇團六七年了吧，起初那麼被看好，擁有最動人的歌聲，接受劇團長的親自教導……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "劇團成員B",
      "text": "好不容易擁有了當主角的機會，現在排練卻遇到了瓶頸。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "劇團成員A",
      "text": "但他把那幾張唱片多聽幾遍，也解決不了問題啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盧西恩",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盧西恩",
      "text": "情感是演員的武器。那麼第一步，你需要理解它們。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盧西恩",
      "text": "老師說，狂喜和狂悲都只是表象，形似的模仿只會讓你喪失對更複雜情感的感知。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盧西恩",
      "text": "可是要怎麼……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盧西恩",
      "text": "絕望，真正的絕望會讓你失去最珍視之物，同時為你打開一扇新的門……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盧西恩",
      "text": "你將聆聽一切你不曾聆聽之低語，你將目睹一切你不曾目睹之景象，你將感悟一切你不曾感悟之情感……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盧西恩",
      "text": "你將成為，萬物的明鏡，戲劇本身。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盧西恩",
      "text": "像這樣——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盧西恩",
      "text": "咳，咳咳——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "盧西恩毀掉了自己的歌喉。\n源石結晶在一瞬間灌入傷口，疼痛與絕望將他淹沒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉淵",
      "text": "血……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盧西恩",
      "text": "痛……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉淵",
      "text": "盧西恩，別怕，我在這裡！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉淵",
      "text": "到底發生什麼事情了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盧西恩",
      "text": "（嘶啞的嗚咽）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盧西恩",
      "text": "（變化的聲線）原來……這就是……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉淵",
      "text": "盧西恩，是你自己把自己弄成這樣的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉淵",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉淵",
      "text": "你還記得我之前的那次演出……或者說刺殺嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉淵",
      "text": "我失敗了。他們說，我是個可悲的懦夫。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉淵",
      "text": "盧西恩，我已經不再是備受期待的藝術之子，我也不在乎那些孤立與嘲笑，因為我的心在那場演出後就已經不在劇團了……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉淵",
      "text": "但我還是留下來了……我們來自同個家鄉，我們是……朋友。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉淵",
      "text": "你答應過我，不會像他們那樣……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盧西恩",
      "text": "老師的話……是對的……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉淵",
      "text": "不……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉淵",
      "text": "我害怕……這座劇團，還有現在的你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盧西恩",
      "text": "總之，它會比你想像中的更有效。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝莉",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝莉",
      "text": "希望我永遠用不到你教我的“小技巧”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
